@FCFinance_HostAddress = https://localhost:7148

# 1) Faça login e copie o "token" da resposta para a variável abaixo.
POST {{FCFinance_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "seu-login", "senha": "sua-senha", "manterConectado": false }

###

@token = cole-o-token-aqui

# 2) Exemplos de chamadas autenticadas
GET {{FCFinance_HostAddress}}/api/RegisteredValue?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{FCFinance_HostAddress}}/api/Category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{FCFinance_HostAddress}}/api/Goals/priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
